  "audio_sha256": "5f13f66e6f8e7e5b08918be860464fd669724caf5d8621cbdc7cf6e536db68bf",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0013",
      "text": "现在，我们再从价值怎样形成的角度考察生产过程。",
      "start_ms": 200,
      "end_ms": 4720,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0014",
      "text": "我们已经知道，商品的价值取决于其中包含多少劳动，也就是生产它所需的社会必要劳动时间。",
      "start_ms": 5440,
      "end_ms": 13840,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0015",
      "text": "资本家生产出来的产品也遵循这个原则。",
      "start_ms": 14560,
      "end_ms": 18240,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0016",
      "text": "因此，我们首先要计算其中包含了多少劳动。",
      "start_ms": 19720,
      "end_ms": 23720,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0017",
      "text": "就以纱为例。",
      "start_ms": 24520,
      "end_ms": 25760,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0018",
      "text": "生产纱，首先需要原料。",
      "start_ms": 26440,
      "end_ms": 28760,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    }
  ]
}
